    {
        "text": "(Knocks here and there)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha! Now that was an impressive explosion!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A good thing the test site was empty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me see...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chamber pressure, off the charts. Same goes for temperature readings, and load capacity too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems like it'll need reinforcement to perform well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next, final adjustments to the previous configuration, loosen the belt, tighten the screws, and... done!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "My newest masterpiece, the 'Invincible Cool Thing' will be fully operational. As long as I don't run into another accident!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I should get rid of all these explosives first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "Safety first! Avoid open flames...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Knocks here and there)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
