        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? What's a beast-man?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He can speak too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why wouldn't I be able to? Hey, you there, Durins, did you crawl up from the underground?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4143_sensi_1#15$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Durins'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is he talking about us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "See any other short ones around here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4143_sensi_1#15$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you saying me and Chilchuck look like the same race to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#15$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you guys have 'Half-foot' here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What are you talking about? Is something wrong with you all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, have you seen our High Priest here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "High Priest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Old guy, shorter than me, wears glasses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's he doing in such a dangerous place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dunno. He thinks in mysterious ways.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, we haven't run into any old men.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He also moves in mysterious ways.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guess I should just give up and get back to the tribe, then. Like all the times I went out and looked for him before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Goodbye, strange tourists!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait! Could I ask if you've heard of Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. Lucky for you, but also unlucky. Because I feel like I have, but also not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's someone else in the tribe who I'm sure knows where this Whatever Island is though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that person happens to be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That High Priest you're looking for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bingo.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "text": "How's this? Come back with me. We hardly ever find him when we go looking, but he always comes back sooner or later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_village",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So basically, you guys were on an island with a huge dungeon, and somehow ended up here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "More or less. Do you know anything about it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh... What's an island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#14$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? It's... a landmass completely surrounded by sea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's a sea?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... a large body of water?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean a lake? You really like to use strange words.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, is it because we're inland right now and you haven't heard of...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's because your questions are so strange! I've never heard of a sea, an island, or a Merini Village. Were you swept here from the other side of Terra by someone's tail or something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Terra'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's what we're standing on right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#22$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Marcille tries to read the crocodile man's face for any sign he was pranking her."
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, the only message she gets from his eyes is 'Am I talking to a fool?'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_village",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So in short, the one who calls the shots in this tribe of crocodiles\u2014er, Archosauria\u2014is the High Priest. The one Marcille blew up earlier was his...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "His mech.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'Invincible Cool Thing.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if we blew up his 'mech'... would he still be willing to help us find Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine. It would've exploded with or without you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Always manages to blow up somehow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The High Priest is a friendly man. I'm sure he won't blame you if you just explain everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bright Archosauria"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's also a righteous man. He wouldn't leave a group of lost visitors stranded.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bright Archosauria"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's our High Priest!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bright Archosauria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still, we should come up with a way to make amends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it\u2014wait, what's that good smell? Who's cooking today?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bright Archosauria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Durin with the huge beard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
