    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Terra, Acahualla, living paintings, the dungeon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... I can't wrap my head around it all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can use magic here, so at the very least some of the laws of reality are shared...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Falin... I bet I'd be as excited as Laios if you were here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* I miss our days back at the academy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back then...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, the berries that those little birds are eating...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "They look like that fruit Falin offered me back then...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
